# Claude Code: shared agent config IS tracked (settings.json, hooks/, skills/,
# commands/, agents/). Volatile session state (worktrees, local overrides) is not.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
.claude/settings.local.json
